________________________________________
 END-TO-END FLOW (Technical)
1.	File uploaded → GCS
2.	GCS emits Pub/Sub event
3.	Pub/Sub pushes event to Cloud Run
4.	Cloud Run:
o	Reads file
o	Chunks text
o	Calls Vertex AI embedding model
o	Writes vectors to GCS
5.	Vertex AI Vector Search indexes vectors
6.	Queries hit endpoint → semantic results


